event: turn_created
data: {"seq":1,"turn_id":"task_0c53f1c8b906e84f831c535135ba2b9e","type":"turn_created","ts":"2026-11-26T18:32:14.181888+08:00","data":{"deep_research":false,"text":"# Sensor readings are added without converting units\n\nRead `records.py` and the unit conversion contract in `units.py`. Fix\n`sensor_totals` in `records.py` to return each sensor's total in volts,\nsumming negative and positive readings. Preserve rejection of unsupported\nunits as a `ValueError`. Leave the conversion helper unchanged.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0},"internal":{"source":"host","type":"task_created","task_seq":1,"payload":{"text":"# Sensor readings are added without converting units\n\nRead `records.py` and the unit conversion contract in `units.py`. Fix\n`sensor_totals` in `records.py` to return each sensor's total in volts,\nsumming negative and positive readings. Preserve rejection of unsupported\nunits as a `ValueError`. Leave the conversion helper unchanged.\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0,"deep_research":false}}}

